/Menlo findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 29 476 [
[(The "set" message sets the output value \050which gets updated normally)]
[(afterwards.\051 The "reset" message causes [samphold~] to act as if the)]
[(given value were the most recent value of the control \050right\051 input.)]
[(Use this, for example, if you reset the incoming [phasor~] but don't)]
[(want the jump reflected in the output as in the example below to the)]
[(right. Plain "reset" is equivalent to "reset infinity" which forces)]
[(the next input to be sampled.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
